        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Fluidity &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Liquid Form</p><p><em>Silver liquid moving constantly beneath translucent skin. The limbs are not fixed in number.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>You Squeeze at full Speed and are not off-guard while squeezing.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Resistance 5</strong> to bludgeoning, piercing and slashing.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Once per round, as a reaction when you are hit, <strong>reduce the damage by your level</strong> as the blow passes through you.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>You move through gaps as small as an inch. Once per day, become <strong>amorphous</strong> for 1 minute: immune to precision damage, and critical hits against you deal normal damage.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
